# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Types:
#   feat:     New feature (MINOR bump)
#   fix:      Bug fix (PATCH bump)
#   perf:     Performance improvement (PATCH bump)
#   refactor: Restructure, no behaviour change (no bump)
#   docs:     Documentation only (no bump)
#   test:     Tests only (no bump)
#   chore:    Maintenance (no bump)
#   ci:       CI/CD config (no bump)
#   build:    Build system / dependencies (no bump)
#
# Subject:
#   - Imperative mood ("add", not "added"/"adds")
#   - No capital on the first letter, no trailing period
#   - Max 72 characters
#   - ONE subject line for the whole commit
#
# Body: bullet points, one per change. Say WHY, not just what.
#
# Breaking change (MAJOR bump):
#   feat(api)!: redesign the training endpoints
#
#   BREAKING CHANGE: endpoints now require a profile_id parameter
